Comment: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:58.90,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnMalgun Gothic\b1\an7\fs80\c&H534B4B&\3c&HF6F6F6&\b1\pos(35,135)}Morioka Mother-and-Child Murder Incident\N{\fs50\b0}Questionable Not Guilty Verdict. Former Judge Responds to Crooked Lawyer's Statements: "It Was Bought."\NCrime & Justice  [+Save]     Published: 11:27\N\NA reporter asked Mr. A, a former judge well-versed in criminal cases, for his opinion on the ruling. Morioka District Court, Morioka, Iwate Prefecture\N"I was extremely surprised that a not-guilty verdict was handed down\Ndespite evidence in the case, such as items being found at the suspect’s home.\NAmong colleagues, some have even said it might have been bought."\N\NRegarding the case, the prosecution said,\N"We simply cannot accept this."
